   "no_dataset_reason": "I could not verify any public dataset of per-cell 3D red-blood-cell surface reconstructions that covers both isotonic and hypotonic conditions. The only candidate with a confirmed landing page is the Zenodo record 'Datasets for 3D shape reconstruction from 2D microscopy images' (https://zenodo.org/records/7031924, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.7031924). Its page calls the data 'single cell datasets' and does not name the cell type or list osmotic conditions, so I could not confirm that it holds red cells at all. A search for the Simionato confocal red-cell dataset found no deposit with a DOI. Published quantitative-phase and tomography red-cell data are mostly in paper supplements or not deposited. Naming an unverified dataset would risk fabrication, so I am returning null."
